## Authentication

Create a service key (Development → Keys → Service keys, as a super admin)
or a legacy private app in your HubSpot portal settings and copy its access
token. The provider reads the token from the `HUBSPOT_ACCESS_TOKEN`
environment variable:

```shell
export HUBSPOT_ACCESS_TOKEN="pat-..."
```

A token set explicitly in the provider configuration takes precedence over
the environment variable. Prefer the environment variable to keep credentials
out of your configuration files and state.

